
### Check database connection
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Create an interview
POST http://localhost:3000/api/interviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Technical Interview",
  "interviewerId": 1,
  "candidateId": 2,
  "duration": 60
}

### Get all interviews
GET http://localhost:3000/api/interviews

### Get one interview by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/interviews/1
### Create a test interview
POST http://localhost:4000/api/interviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Demo Technical Interview",
  "duration": 30,
  "interviewerId": 1,
  "candidateId": 2
}

### Get the newly created interview
GET http://localhost:4000/api/interviews/3
### Check the database connection
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Submit Mock Test Answers
POST http://localhost:4000/api/mock-tests/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Python",
  "answers": {
    "1": 1,
    "2": 2,
    "3": 1,
    "4": 2,
    "5": 1,
    "6": 2,
    "7": 2,
    "8": 2,
    "9": 1,
    "10": 1
  }
}

### Create a new test interview
POST http://localhost:4000/api/interviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "API Test Interview",
  "duration": 45,
  "interviewerId": 1,
  "candidateId": 2
}

### Get Python Mock Test Questions
GET http://localhost:4000/api/mock-tests/Python/questions
